AI models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The embedding models and GGUF instruct models TicketLens downloads at runtime
are NOT part of this distribution and are NOT covered by this project's license.
Each carries its own terms (some, such as Gemma, have use policies that restrict
certain applications). Review the model card on Hugging Face for any model you
use, especially before commercial or regulated deployment.
